WEBVTT

00:00:08.373 --> 00:00:09.374
Transylvania.

00:00:09.548 --> 00:00:10.897
You want to go where?

00:00:11.071 --> 00:00:12.246
Transylvania.
As soon as possible.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.292
We don't fly
direct to Transylvania.

00:00:14.466 --> 00:00:15.989
You don't?

00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:18.078
You can go to Bucharest,
but you'll have to

00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:19.906
switch planes in
Chicago and then Zurich.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.082
So, when would we get there?

00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:24.694
Well,
the Chicago flight's delayed
due to bad weather.

00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:25.782
[GROWLING]

00:00:30.395 --> 00:00:31.918
So, two seats in coach?

00:00:32.397 --> 00:00:33.180
No!

00:00:33.964 --> 00:00:35.400
No! Yes.

00:00:48.021 --> 00:00:50.197
[JONATHAN CHEERING]

00:00:53.374 --> 00:00:53.984
[MAKING NONSENSICAL SOUNDS]

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:58.423
You have to go now?
When we finally
have no traffic.

00:00:58.597 --> 00:01:00.120
You're killing me, Blobby.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.781
[CHEERING]

00:01:10.217 --> 00:01:13.090
I still have some cloud on me.
Gotta do a selfie!

00:01:13.264 --> 00:01:14.613
Johnny! Not now!

00:01:14.787 --> 00:01:16.006
Okay. Maybe later.

00:01:17.572 --> 00:01:18.399
[HONKING]

00:01:22.447 --> 00:01:24.754
This scooter
thing's out of juice.
We're never gonna make it.

00:01:24.928 --> 00:01:26.320
Frank, blow.

00:01:35.765 --> 00:01:36.853
Now!

00:01:42.249 --> 00:01:42.946
[ALL CHEERING]

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.745
[DRACULA LAUGHING]

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.879
How fun is this?
Why are you laughing?
You like that?

00:02:03.053 --> 00:02:04.358
Watch this.

00:02:04.532 --> 00:02:06.012
[BLOBBY MAKING
NONSENSICAL SOUNDS]

00:02:06.186 --> 00:02:07.013
DRACULA:
Coochie-coochie-coochie-coo!

00:02:09.146 --> 00:02:10.060
[GASPS] [MURRAY SCREAMING]

00:02:16.196 --> 00:02:17.894
Now this is flying,
Denisovich.

00:02:18.068 --> 00:02:20.113
Like a vampire.

00:02:20.287 --> 00:02:20.984
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:21.636 --> 00:02:22.376
DENNIS: Wee!

00:02:23.856 --> 00:02:26.467
That's my boy. Look at you go.

00:02:26.641 --> 00:02:27.468
[LAUGHING]

00:02:31.821 --> 00:02:32.517
[QUACKING]

00:02:35.738 --> 00:02:38.871
DENNIS: You're the coolest guy
who wears a cape, Papa Drac.

00:02:39.045 --> 00:02:39.872
[MURRAY SCREAMING]

00:02:51.318 --> 00:02:52.145
Ugh!

00:03:00.675 --> 00:03:01.372
[DENNIS CHUCKLES]

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.552
[DIALING TONE]

00:03:07.726 --> 00:03:10.294
So, hey, when are you going
to get here already?

00:03:10.468 --> 00:03:12.035
We've been waiting...

00:03:12.862 --> 00:03:13.906
[GASPS]

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.126
Give me my son.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.519
We just went out
for some avocados.

00:03:18.693 --> 00:03:20.086
Mommy! I flew!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.958
I saw.

00:03:22.132 --> 00:03:23.786
DRACULA:
♪ Mother's already
nutsy koo koo

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:26.527
♪ Nutsy koo koo

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:28.355
♪ Koo koo COUNSELOR:
♪ Oh, dear. Oh, dear

00:03:28.529 --> 00:03:30.140
♪ Oh, my devil
I have to follow protocol

00:03:30.314 --> 00:03:31.794
♪ That ain't happening
That ain't happening

00:03:31.968 --> 00:03:33.273
♪ Mother's already

00:03:33.447 --> 00:03:34.274
♪ Koo koo

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.320
♪ Koo koo ♪

00:03:44.589 --> 00:03:47.810
I was worried
Dennis wasn't safe
around other monsters.

00:03:47.984 --> 00:03:50.856
Now I don't even feel like
he's safe around you.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.075
But I was just...

00:03:52.249 --> 00:03:53.816
What was it you said?

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:57.036
Human, monster, unicorn.
That it didn't matter?

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.256
Well,
I just know his life would...

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.649
We'll have his birthday party
here on Wednesday.

00:04:01.824 --> 00:04:03.651
Then we're moving.

00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:06.567
Please, Mavey. Don't leave.

00:04:06.741 --> 00:04:09.788
Maybe you've let humans
into your hotel, Dad.

00:04:09.962 --> 00:04:12.051
But I don't
think you've let them
into your heart.

00:04:27.414 --> 00:04:28.285
[SIGHS]

00:04:30.635 --> 00:04:31.288
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

00:04:35.422 --> 00:04:36.293
[SIGHS]

00:04:43.822 --> 00:04:44.649
Hmm...

00:04:56.704 --> 00:04:59.185
DENNIS: I can do it.
I can do it.

00:04:59.925 --> 00:05:03.146
I'm a bat. I'm a bat.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.148
I'm a bat.
I'm a bat. I'm a bat!

00:05:05.322 --> 00:05:06.845
Dennis?
What are you doing, sweetie?

00:05:07.019 --> 00:05:09.152
Uh... Nothing.

00:05:09.326 --> 00:05:12.198
Careful. Let me help
you down from there.

00:05:12.372 --> 00:05:14.331
Are you getting
excited about your big party?

00:05:14.505 --> 00:05:16.246
I guess so.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.205
You know who's coming?
Daddy's whole family.

00:05:19.379 --> 00:05:21.555
Grandpa Mike
and Grandma Linda.

00:05:21.729 --> 00:05:25.385
All your cousins
and aunts and uncles
who love you so much.

00:05:25.559 --> 00:05:29.433
And then they're
gonna be with us
when we move to California.

00:05:29.607 --> 00:05:34.046
Mommy, are we going away
cebause I'm not a monster?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:37.658
What?
No. Dennis, of course not.

00:05:37.832 --> 00:05:40.226
It's just grown-up stuff.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.837
Okay.
But what about Papa Drac?

00:05:43.012 --> 00:05:45.492
He's gonna be here all alone.

00:05:45.666 --> 00:05:48.452
Papa Drac has to stay
here to run the hotel.

00:05:48.626 --> 00:05:51.020
But he'll visit us.
And we'll visit him.

00:05:51.194 --> 00:05:52.630
Can we call him every night?

00:05:52.804 --> 00:05:54.327
Sure.

00:06:00.029 --> 00:06:01.552
Awesome!

00:06:01.726 --> 00:06:03.467
Hello. We're here.

00:06:03.641 --> 00:06:04.381
[ALL GREETING]

00:06:05.773 --> 00:06:11.083
♪ The night brings
Johnny's family here

00:06:11.257 --> 00:06:15.740
♪ To take away all
that Drac holds dear ♪

00:06:15.914 --> 00:06:16.871
Welcome, welcome.

00:06:17.046 --> 00:06:19.178
♪ Hide your feelings

00:06:19.352 --> 00:06:22.965
♪ Keep them all inside ♪

00:06:25.968 --> 00:06:26.707
[GROANING]

00:06:30.146 --> 00:06:32.757
Dude, why do you wanna leave?
This place is out of control.

00:06:32.931 --> 00:06:34.106
I don't wanna leave.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.239
All these awesome
freakazoids!

00:06:36.413 --> 00:06:37.718
So, who's the
coolest monster?

00:06:37.892 --> 00:06:39.503
Kakie.

00:06:39.677 --> 00:06:41.026
Kakie.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.114
Kakie.
What a wussbag. [CHUCKLES]

00:06:43.463 --> 00:06:46.858
Isn't it nice to have
the whole family together?

00:06:47.032 --> 00:06:50.949
Mavis, do you have
any cousins or
thingies in your family?

00:06:51.123 --> 00:06:53.125
No. It's just been me and Dad.

00:06:53.299 --> 00:06:55.823
I never did ask how
you lost your mom.

00:06:55.998 --> 00:06:57.869
Oh. She was
killed by angry humans.

00:06:58.043 --> 00:06:59.088
Oh...

00:06:59.262 --> 00:07:02.004
♪ Awkward ♪

00:07:02.178 --> 00:07:04.354
But there is my Grandpa Vlad.

00:07:04.528 --> 00:07:06.095
Oh, you have a grandpa?

00:07:06.269 --> 00:07:07.487
Yeah. He'll be at the party.
I invited him.

00:07:07.661 --> 00:07:09.011
[SPITS]

00:07:09.185 --> 00:07:11.535
You invited him?

00:07:11.709 --> 00:07:15.017
Dad, he's never seen Dennis.
I wanted them to
meet once before we go.

00:07:15.191 --> 00:07:19.325
Sure.
Great. Peachy. Good old Vlad.

00:07:19.499 --> 00:07:21.458
Anybody have a wet wipe?

